            <description><![CDATA[Pre-requisites]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="pre-requisites">Pre-requisites<a href="https://tiktzuki.github.io/blog/2025/10/26/mcp-atlassian-integration#pre-requisites" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Pre-requisites" title="Direct link to Pre-requisites" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<p>Install Docker (if not already installed)
Visit <a href="https://docs.docker.com/engine/install/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">https://docs.docker.com/engine/install/</a> and follow the instructions.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="-authentication-setup">🔐 Authentication Setup<a href="https://tiktzuki.github.io/blog/2025/10/26/mcp-atlassian-integration#-authentication-setup" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 🔐 Authentication Setup" title="Direct link to 🔐 Authentication Setup" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<ol>
<li class="">Go to <a href="https://id.atlassian.com/manage-profile/security/api-tokens" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">https://id.atlassian.com/manage-profile/security/api-tokens</a></li>
<li class="">Click <strong>Create API token</strong>, name it</li>
<li class="">Copy the <strong>API_TOKEN</strong> immediately</li>
</ol>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="integrate-mcp-server">Integrate MCP Server<a href="https://tiktzuki.github.io/blog/2025/10/26/mcp-atlassian-integration#integrate-mcp-server" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Integrate MCP Server" title="Direct link to Integrate MCP Server" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="with-cursor">With Cursor<a href="https://tiktzuki.github.io/blog/2025/10/26/mcp-atlassian-integration#with-cursor" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to With Cursor" title="Direct link to With Cursor" translate="no">​</a></h3>
<p>Source: <a href="https://developers.make.com/mcp-server/make-cloud-mcp-server/usage-with-cursor" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">Cursor MCP</a>, <a href="https://docs.cursor.com/en/context/mcp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">Usage</a></p>
<p>To use the cloud-based server with Cursor:</p>
<ul>
<li class="">
<p>Open your Cursor account.</p>
</li>
<li class="">
<p>On the upper right-hand side, click the gear icon to open the Cursor Settings dialog.</p>
</li>
<li class="">
<p>In the left sidebar, click Tools &amp; Integrations.</p>
</li>
<li class="">
<p>Under MCP Tools, click New MCP Server to open the editor for the mcp.json file.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="https://developers.make.com/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3035801395-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FyHSLDvK9bMDQI1lCXXt6%252Fuploads%252FSzGd2KAWMGDzFWnEQfpS%252Fimage%2520%285%29.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3Daa4eadff-b879-4143-9eed-a89e3a8cf306&amp;width=768&amp;dpr=2&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=d62d5d20&amp;sv=2" alt="image.png" class="img_ev3q">
