<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="log-work-magically">Log work magically<a href="https://tiktzuki.github.io/blog/2025/10/26/mcp-atlassian-integration#log-work-magically" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Log work magically" title="Direct link to Log work magically" translate="no">​</a></h2>
